<!-- S-411 Edition 2.0.0 test dataset TDS6: textual ice report with reporting
     stations (German Baltic coast). The report text is the authentic BSH
     weekly ice report of 2025-02-17 (ftp.bsh.de/outgoing/eisbericht/,
     2025_02_17_08KW.pdf), abridged. Station codes use the Baltic Sea Ice Code
     (digits A/S/T/K; value tables per WMO No. 574 and the BSH Eisbericht key).
     Demonstrates the reportInformation association: ice reports transmitted
     to shipping as a complement to the ice chart. -->
